      "text": "4Control Tone"
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b35ae",
      "va": "0x7ba9ae",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "Control Tone"
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b3bb2",
      "va": "0x7bafb2",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": ".=Control Tone"
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b3d0a",
      "va": "0x7bb10a",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": " MIDI "
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b3d36",
      "va": "0x7bb136",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": " MIDI "
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b415a",
      "va": "0x7bb55a",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "Control Tone"
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b4b3a",
      "va": "0x7bbf3a",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": " Control Tone, "
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b4d94",
      "va": "0x7bc194",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": " MIDI "
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b4e50",
      "va": "0x7bc250",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": " MIDI."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b58f2",
      "va": "0x7bccf2",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "e audio sur votre logiciel DJ/de production.pLorsque Control Tone est s"
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b5bb4",
      "va": "0x7bcfb4",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "cifiez un canal MIDI pour le mixeur."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b5c58",
      "va": "0x7bd058",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": " par un autre appareil MIDI."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b65a6",
      "va": "0x7bd9a6",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "r Ihre DJ/Produktionssoftware.]Wenn Control Tone ausgew"
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b67f4",
      "va": "0x7bdbf4",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "hler %s.|Stellen Sie einen MIDI-Kanal am Mixer ein."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b6860",
      "va": "0x7bdc60",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "hlen Sie einen, der nicht gleichzeitig von anderen MIDI-Ger"
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b721c",
      "va": "0x7be61c",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "LConfigurare le impostazioni di ingresso audio del software DJ/di produzione.YA Control Tone scelto, scegliere \"PC\" dei selettori dei canali di ingresso desiderati %s.JConfigurare le impostazioni di uscita audio del software DJ/di produzione.dPer mandare segnale audio USB %s, scegliere \"PC\" dei selettori dei canali di ingresso desiderati %s.eScegliere un canale MIDI del mixer."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b7514",
      "va": "0x7be914",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "Sceglierne uno non al momento usato sa un altro dispositivo MIDI."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b7b46",
      "va": "0x7bef46",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "Los controladores ASIO del %s no se han instalado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b7c12",
      "va": "0x7bf012",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "n del controlador. Instale de nuevo los controladores."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b7c90",
      "va": "0x7bf090",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "n de controlador"
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b7f66",
      "va": "0x7bf366",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": " seleccionado Control Tone, seleccione \"PC\" para el conmutador (o conmutadores) selector de entrada del canal deseado en el %s.KConfigure los ajustes de salida de audio para su software de DJ/producci"
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b821c",
      "va": "0x7bf61c",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "Establezca un canal MIDI del mezclador."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b82ca",
      "va": "0x7bf6ca",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "neamente por cualquier otro aparato MIDI."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b84e4",
      "va": "0x7bf8e4",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "o do controlador"
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b8d40",
      "va": "0x7c0140",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "Quando tiver sido seleccionado Control Tone, seleccione \"PC\" no(s) interruptor(es) selector(es) de entrada do canal pretendido no %s.BConfigure os ajustes de sa"
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b8ef4",
      "va": "0x7c02f4",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "udio USB no %s seleccionando \"PC\" nos interruptores selectores de entrada do canal no %s.zDefina um canal MIDI no misturador."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b9030",
      "va": "0x7c0430",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "o esteja a ser utilizado por outros dispositivos MIDI."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b99f4",
      "va": "0x7c0df4",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "EAudio-ingangsinstellingen configureren voor uw DJ/productieprogramma.jAls de Control Tone is geselecteerd, kiest u \"PC\" met de gewenste kanaal-ingangskeuzeschakelaar(s) van %s.FAudio-uitgangsinstellingen configureren voor uw DJ/productieprogramma.pOm een USB-audiosignaal naar %s te sturen, kiest u \"PC\" met de gewenste kanaal-ingangskeuzeschakelaar(s) van %s.tStel een MIDI-kanaal van het mengpanee"
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3b9d20",
      "va": "0x7c1120",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "Selecteer een kanaal dat niet in gebruik is door andere MIDI-apparatuur."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3ba5f4",
      "va": "0x7c19f4",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "CConfigure the audio input settings for your DJ/production software.cWhen Control Tone is selected, select \"PC\" for the desired channel input selector switch(es) on %s.DConfigure the audio output settings for your DJ/production software.gTo input a USB audio signal to %s, select \"PC\" for the desired channel input selector switch(es) on %s.dSet a MIDI channel of the mixer."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3ba8e2",
      "va": "0x7c1ce2",
      "encoding": "utf-16le",
      "text": "Select one that is not concurrently used by any other MIDI devices."
    }
  ],
